            "review_title": "Review at Al Fresco's Binh Duong",
            "review_text": "_wdarlingvn\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nYummy Food\nMay 2018 • Friends\nI like their food and their service is good. The place is clean and you have confidence when eating here. The only down-side is that the prices are inflated. They charge more because it isn't Vietnamese food but they over-charge. If you are willing to pay 2 or 3 times the price for a meal in a comparable Vietnamese place then you won't be disappointed. I eat here occassionally\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
