            "review_title": "Review at Al Fresco's Binh Duong",
            "review_text": "Mike B\n18 contributions\n0\nGood food choices that aren't all asian\nAug 2018\nThis is part of the Alfresco group. The menu had some interesting choices from garlic bread, chicken parmagiana, salads, mexican food and pizzas. So if you are looking for non Asian food give these restaurants a try. Service is good, but a word of warning - don't go on a weekend evening. The mall is packed with Vietnamese families and the noise is tremendous.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
